  "releaseNotes": "## 2.0.0-beta.23 - 2026-09-01\n\n- Completes upgrades started by an older AgentOS page after the new Core reconnects: the new page verifies the signed release again and automatically synchronizes a mismatched installed AgentOS Runtime before reporting success\n- Treats a Runtime-only repair as complete without restarting the already current Core service; Core restarts remain limited to upgrades that actually switch the immutable Core release\n- Keeps Core-only and Cube deployments Core-only, while local Runtime installs continue to reuse AgentOS Runtime `1.0.0-beta.7` when that exact signed component version is already installed\n- Includes the signed paired Core/Runtime upgrade contract and the Codex and OpenCode startup improvements prepared in `2.0.0-beta.22`\n\n### Verification\n\n- Passed focused previous-upgrade continuation, Runtime-only repair, paired online and offline upgrade, unchanged-Runtime, signature, checksum, target, and immutable Core switch tests\n- Passed the complete production build and all 329 TypeScript, Server, UI, and TypeScript SDK tests, plus the Sandbox VMM Go suite and Java 8 SDK tests",
